218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 141 0 R
/E (Logistic Regression was used as the baseline model due to its simplicity and interpretability. It estimates the probability of each treatment outcome class using a linear combination of the input features. Class weighting \(class_weight='balanced'\) was applied to counteract the dataset's imbalance, giving the minority "recovered" class proportionally more influence during training. This model provides a clear reference point for evaluating whether more complex models offer meaningful improvement.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
